OL,3,GNEWSAMan raped and attacked woman in
OL,4,Acampaign of abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who attacked a woman with a knife
OL,7,Fand subjected her to weeks of violent
OL,8,Fabuse, including rape and sexual
OL,9,Fassault, has been jailed for 24 years.
OL,11,FPolice began their investigation on 30
OL,12,FNovember 2025 when the victim told a
OL,13,Frelative that she had been attacked by
OL,14,FJames White, of St Michael's Crescent,
OL,15,Fwho then fled the address.
OL,17,FThe victim said White, 39, had used a
OL,18,Fknife to cut her on her abdomen, and
OL,19,Fshe had suffered bruising over her
OL,20,Fface, as well as injuries to her back
OL,21,Fand torso.
