OL,5,
OL,6,FWhite was arrested shortly after, and
OL,7,Fpleaded not guilty to charges relating
OL,8,Fto assault, sexual assault, rape and
OL,9,Fdomestic abuse. A jury at Warwick Crown
OL,10,FCourt found him guilty of all offences
OL,11,Fon 9 June.
